      "filename": "亜細亜大観 04 103 \"新高山 （臺灣）\".jpg",
      "title": "File:亜細亜大観 04 103 \"新高山 （臺灣）\".jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/%E4%BA%9C%E7%B4%B0%E4%BA%9C%E5%A4%A7%E8%A6%B3_04_103_%22%E6%96%B0%E9%AB%98%E5%B1%B1_%EF%BC%88%E8%87%BA%E7%81%A3%EF%BC%89%22.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
